{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A girl goes on a journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Following in her mother's footsteps who ruined the world...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/extras/837ac93d88bca2f7510394222cdcb8c7.poster.avif?t=1758243323\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/extras/837ac93d88bca2f7510394222cdcb8c7.webm?t=1758243323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/extras/837ac93d88bca2f7510394222cdcb8c7.mp4?t=1758243323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world devastated by the war between humans and witches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hyke, a young, white-haired girl, travels across the world, searching for her long-lost mother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually, she enters an unexplored land called the &quot;Forbidden Areas.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hyke's destiny is set in motion when she encounters the &quot;Meteos,&quot; witches who guard the Forbidden Areas...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Witches, camping, and an adventure across the world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/extras/48c1cca72452c3b75bf329bbc063e055.poster.avif?t=1758243323\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/extras/48c1cca72452c3b75bf329bbc063e055.webm?t=1758243323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/extras/48c1cca72452c3b75bf329bbc063e055.mp4?t=1758243323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a thrilling 2D top-down action pixel RPG with Hyke, a witch who loves camping, as you explore dangerous forbidden zones filled with magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/extras/b9811d1a6ff83e499d7a65498c98f0e3.poster.avif?t=1758243323\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/extras/b9811d1a6ff83e499d7a65498c98f0e3.webm?t=1758243323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/extras/b9811d1a6ff83e499d7a65498c98f0e3.mp4?t=1758243323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you're resting from your journey, enjoy the warmth of campfires, listen to soothing music, and relax before setting out on more daring adventures with your companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/extras/0293aba44dd07aaf58dde45b03f4e4ca.poster.avif?t=1758243323\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/extras/0293aba44dd07aaf58dde45b03f4e4ca.webm?t=1758243323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/extras/0293aba44dd07aaf58dde45b03f4e4ca.mp4?t=1758243323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Pixel art with stunning details: Beautiful, vibrant 2D-pixel graphics that bring the world to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Charming witches: Let these cute, powerful, and unique witches lead you through an exciting adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Diverse gameplay: Play as seven distinct characters, each offering a unique experience and allowing various strategies to conquer different stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Relaxing camp life: Take breaks at camp to rest, sort through your favorite gear, and personalize your campsite!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Cooking buffs: Prepare meals at camp to gain buffs for the next stage.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Reminiscence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2680380/9a33b22ec67f745a1c00dab03da68b59efc92c94.jpg"},{"name":"Mother's Footprints","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2680380/bc4a444cb765763482a38dbdc9bfedc2a8acef1e.jpg"},{"name":"Rune Hint","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2680380/6baf159f0090b3b8874a76bfb115cf3377765e22.jpg"},{"name":"Special Revelation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2680380/ebc551cf506bafa558d717817b31bf0379a72c3a.jpg"},{"name":"Inheritors of Magic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2680380/ea9c1fcfee72410ca2161e5e6089f923fb2ba1f0.jpg"},{"name":"Truth About Mother","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2680380/fd799262d76fcc112c5b8e5a83efafe445a6762b.jpg"},{"name":"Riko's Identity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2680380/7443f65f7265f7051c9d6c81a77812233ba27a32.jpg"},{"name":"Sacrifice and Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2680380/4baece251169167b2189626761418f2e98d3509d.jpg"},{"name":"Leaving the Nest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2680380/a9eff116bf14ea032c8b3ed0716ca716c20102ef.jpg"},{"name":"Moon Heroine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2680380/8f1b67dbfc13efa2da2c99dbfa491c17336c47f3.jpg"}],"total":48},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2680380?t=1758243323","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/f759f079ac740f73fd4d0118a8d9030ba5e93e54/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758243323","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/c79c24e680583b2c154bc9f96ff102523319d541/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758243323","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/c79c24e680583b2c154bc9f96ff102523319d541/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758243323","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A girl goes on a journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Following in her mother's footsteps who ruined the world...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/extras/837ac93d88bca2f7510394222cdcb8c7.poster.avif?t=1758243323\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/extras/837ac93d88bca2f7510394222cdcb8c7.webm?t=1758243323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/extras/837ac93d88bca2f7510394222cdcb8c7.mp4?t=1758243323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world devastated by the war between humans and witches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hyke, a young, white-haired girl, travels across the world, searching for her long-lost mother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually, she enters an unexplored land called the &quot;Forbidden Areas.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hyke's destiny is set in motion when she encounters the &quot;Meteos,&quot; witches who guard the Forbidden Areas...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Witches, camping, and an adventure across the world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/extras/48c1cca72452c3b75bf329bbc063e055.poster.avif?t=1758243323\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/extras/48c1cca72452c3b75bf329bbc063e055.webm?t=1758243323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/extras/48c1cca72452c3b75bf329bbc063e055.mp4?t=1758243323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a thrilling 2D top-down action pixel RPG with Hyke, a witch who loves camping, as you explore dangerous forbidden zones filled with magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/extras/b9811d1a6ff83e499d7a65498c98f0e3.poster.avif?t=1758243323\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/extras/b9811d1a6ff83e499d7a65498c98f0e3.webm?t=1758243323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/extras/b9811d1a6ff83e499d7a65498c98f0e3.mp4?t=1758243323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you're resting from your journey, enjoy the warmth of campfires, listen to soothing music, and relax before setting out on more daring adventures with your companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/extras/0293aba44dd07aaf58dde45b03f4e4ca.poster.avif?t=1758243323\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/extras/0293aba44dd07aaf58dde45b03f4e4ca.webm?t=1758243323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680380/extras/0293aba44dd07aaf58dde45b03f4e4ca.mp4?t=1758243323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Pixel art with stunning details: Beautiful, vibrant 2D-pixel graphics that bring the world to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Charming witches: Let these cute, powerful, and unique witches lead you through an exciting adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Diverse gameplay: Play as seven distinct characters, each offering a unique experience and allowing various strategies to conquer different stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Relaxing camp life: Take breaks at camp to rest, sort through your favorite gear, and personalize your campsite!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Cooking buffs: Prepare meals at camp to gain buffs for the next stage.</p>","developers":["Akatsuki Games Inc.","Bl